          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $Q$ be a finite column generator and let $\\nu\\ge\\max_{j<n}r_j$. If $\\nu>0$, then\n\n$$P:=I+Q/\\nu$$\n\nhas nonnegative entries and every column sums to one. If $\\nu=0$, then $Q=0$.",
